WEBVTT

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.040
<i>That day, that time...</i>

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:11.510
<i>We were thrown into the future,
into the year 2388.</i>

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:15.890
<i>We continued to struggle
without a way to return to our time.</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.350
<i>Some people who felt we were at a dead end
under these circumstances</i>

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:22.310
<i>released Mayor Muta</i>

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:25.230
<i>and planned to negotiate with
the Revisions again.</i>

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:30.980
<i>All that did was cause the deaths
of Mayor Muta and Chief Kuroiwa.</i>

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:35.070
<i>Now that we've lost two people
who held Shibuya together,</i>

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:37.280
<i>what are we going to do?</i>

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.870
Yes? Izumi speaking.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.460
The Revisions?

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.920
Can you give me more details?

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.380
<i>At the scramble crossing,</i>

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.590
<i>there's someone calling herself
a Revision.</i>

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.010
<i>They said that in a few hours,</i>

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:57.090
<i>they will start
seizing people indiscriminately.</i>

00:00:58.010 --> 00:00:59.140
You must be kidding.

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:00.390
What about that Revision?

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:03.480
<i>The police currently have her surrounded.</i>

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>Since the Chief is dead,
we don't know who's in command.</i>

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:12.280
All right.

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:16.570
Anyway, I'll be there right away
with the SDS members.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:20.240
Milo.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:29.960
I have something to report.

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:32.000
My time leap is coming soon.

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:33.170
What?

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:35.510
You mean you're going away? From here?

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:38.550
If we lose you too, Milo...

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.350
You must be kidding.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:21.200
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:26.200
<i>Like I told you before,
I have to save you in 2010.</i>

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:32.540
<i>With the death of Keisaku, there's been
a big deviation in AHRV's predictions.</i>

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:36.630
Of course, I plan on fighting
by your side until the last minute.

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:37.960
Are you sure?

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.300
You're really leaving?

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:41.720
Yes, I am.

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:44.050
You must be crazy!

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:46.930
You're leaving us at a time like this?

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:49.930
Don't you care about us
who are trapped here in the future?

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:53.900
Do you only care about
the AHRV mission going well?

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:55.230
Hold on, Daisuke.

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:57.480
-Milo is going back to save you!
-I know!

00:03:58.360 --> 00:03:59.530
I know that,

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:01.030
but...

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:06.830
<i>At present, Civilians are</i>

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:09.370
<i>gathering at the border.</i>

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:11.750
<i>What about that Revision?</i>

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.790
<i>She gave that warning then disappeared.</i>

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:16.130
We need to dispatch
the String Puppets right away.

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:17.750
They are running out of power.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.340
What's wrong?

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:21.510
It looks like there isn't much power left.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:24.680
It's because we have been supplying power

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:27.470
and providing electricity
for our daily living.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.140
You're kidding.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:31.390
The String Puppets
won't function properly like this.

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:33.440
And the Revisions are going to attack.

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:37.270
Does that mean we can only fight
with what's left in the String Puppets?

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:39.320
There's hardly anything left.

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:41.940
If we're going to fight
using the String Puppets,

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.280
they would probably last
for only half a day.

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:46.780
Half a day?

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:50.700
Are we going to die?

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:54.580
Milo, isn't there something we can do?

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:57.330
I get it.

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:00.050
Since you'll soon be going to the past,

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:01.920
this doesn't matter to you.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:03.340
Daisuke!

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:04.630
How dare you say that?

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:08.930
Don't you see that she's leaving us behind
and escaping to the past?

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:10.930
Cut it out, Daisuke.

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:14.890
I didn't want to leave you all here.

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:18.270
But this is our destiny.

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:19.270
Destiny?

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:21.900
You call this destiny?

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:25.400
All you've been doing
is obey orders from your superiors!

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:26.700
Daisuke.

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:29.620
First, we lost Keisaku,
then Mr. Kuroiwa too.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:33.410
Now, we're going to lose even you, Milo?

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:40.630
Saving everyone may have been impossible
from the start.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.050
What?

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:44.510
How are we supposed to protect this place?

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.470
I mean, we're not special.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:49.140
We're just high school students.

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.430
We've been trying to do the impossible.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.860
That's so unlike you two, Gai and Daisuke!

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:02.570
But...

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.490
I don't know how we can protect everyone.

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:08.740
I have no idea
why we're doing this anymore.

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:11.620
Are...

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:14.490
What's wrong?
Did you get separated from your mother?

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:18.250
Are we all going to die?

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:21.330
That's what everyone is saying.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.630
No, that won't happen.

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:26.630
You and your mom

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:29.800
will be protected by these guys
using their String Puppets.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:30.800
Really?

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:32.390
-Yes.
-Kana!

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:34.100
Mom!

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:46.570
You know what? We need to do this!

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:50.070
The future of the people here
depends on us!

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:53.450
What's going on? You're all here.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:55.910
How come you haven't dispatched yet?

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:59.370
Because the String Puppets
are running out of power.

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:01.670
Are you serious?

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:02.960
You're kidding.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:05.960
Without those,
we can't fight off the Revisions!

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:07.880
Can't anything be done?

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.180
Milo is having a look at them now.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:14.470
But as the government,
we need to give the people some assurance.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:17.970
Let's use the Shibuya Emergency
Broadcast System

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:19.390
to reassure the people--

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:20.440
Wait!

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:22.810
Why are you giving the orders, Ms. Izumi?

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.270
You're just the SDS' supervisor--

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:27.730
Then why the heck don't you take charge?

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:30.240
-Without Chief Kuroiwa or Mr. Muta around,
-I didn't mean...

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.820
-if someone doesn't take the lead...
-I didn't...

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:37.910
I know they said that the people
on the list are the Revisions' ancestors,

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:40.660
and there will always be some
who will react radically,

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:44.460
<i>but even the first group of returnees
were violently seized.</i>

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:48.960
<i>I really doubt
that many people believe the Revisions.</i>

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:50.090
<i>You're right.</i>

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.800
<i>The enemy did say
they will be indiscriminate.</i>

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:55.600
<i>But where should we hide?</i>

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:59.600
<i>I have an idea. Let's move everyone
to an underground area.</i>

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:01.140
<i>Can it accommodate everyone?</i>

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:03.400
<i>Well, to be honest, I don't know.</i>

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:08.230
<i>But if we use the railroads, which are
off-limits, then we can probably manage.</i>

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:11.950
Then let's announce it right away using
the Shibuya Emergency Broadcast System.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:14.950
Will we be able to do it?
We're running out of time.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.160
We'll help you with that.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.450
To make sure nobody is left behind,
we'll round people up.

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:21.910
Mr. Yokoyama!

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.210
That's a big help.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.790
I'm the Neighborhood Association President
after all.

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:27.670
I thought you were just a mean old man.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:28.630
Hey!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.420
Don't underestimate me.

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:35.140
There's no way I can leave everything
in your hands, you kids!

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:37.180
Ms. Yumiko.

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:41.060
Yes, I've asked her to handle
health services for the neighborhood.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:43.520
I'm glad that I could help.

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.360
Okay, we don't have much time.
Get to work and accomplish your tasks.

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:50.280
<i>Yes, let's get to work right away.</i>

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:51.780
<i>I'll...</i>

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:56.360
Everyone, listen to me.

00:08:56.950 --> 00:09:00.830
I want to propose a plan that
we can implement in Shibuya right now.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:05.330
I've realized that since I'm restricted
by the orders of AHRV,

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:08.130
I may seem useless in your eyes.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:11.960
However, I swear I will succeed

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:16.470
on my mission to save you,
to save Daisuke in 2010.

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:19.510
This is my personal wish.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:24.640
It's all right, Milo.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:27.480
Earlier, Daisuke was just whining.

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:28.730
Right?

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:32.150
That's one thing about him
that still hasn't changed.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:33.860
Hey, stop it.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:51.590
Fortunately, due to tectonic movements,
the crust of the Earth at the border

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:55.130
between Shibuya and the future world
has significant elevation differences.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.220
That limits where the enemy can penetrate.

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:59.890
That's where they battled
the police before, right?

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:01.050
Right.

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:04.520
Then, our weakness
and the Revisions' objective,

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:06.100
the people who aren't their ancestors,

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.190
will be moved to the underground area.

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.560
We're expecting
that they will head that way.

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:14.440
We just need to defeat each enemy
as they appear.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:15.740
SHIBUYA

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:19.410
We'll use everyone as a decoy
to lure in the enemy.

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:21.910
So that we won't waste
the little power we have left,

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.410
we must concentrate our targets
into one area.

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:26.620
We really have our backs against the wall.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:29.870
A String Puppet will snipe from afar.

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:33.130
Another one will take down
any enemy that gets through.

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:36.010
Coordination is essential, Daisuke.

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:37.260
I know.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:40.550
But will the enemy

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.140
gather in the target area?

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:45.520
I'll be the decoy for that.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:48.230
Once they realize
that I'm a member of AHRV,

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:50.310
the Civilians will surely come after me.

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:51.310
You can't do that.

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:55.150
But don't you have to time-leap
to 2010 soon, Milo?

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:57.440
It's all right.

00:10:58.110 --> 00:10:59.990
At least, let me do this for you.

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:04.870
<i>Now, let's discuss the details
of the plan.</i>

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:05.870
<i>Okay.</i>

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:12.670
Proceed orderly and don't panic.

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:15.750
There is enough space for everyone,
so don't worry.

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:27.810
<i>Looks like we will be relying on Milo
until the very end.</i>

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:29.850
Won't we ever see you again?

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:31.600
I'm sure that we won't.

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:35.440
When this is over,
I won't be in this time anymore.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:38.110
Milo, thank you for everything.

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.070
The same goes for you.

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:43.620
Goodbye, Milo.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:45.580
Goodbye, Lu.

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:47.870
Izumi.

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:49.540
You're in command.

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:52.330
Okay. Take care, Milo.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:57.630
JR EAST

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:04.140
Milo.

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:07.100
So, you really are going.

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:09.310
That's right.

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:10.730
Well,

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:13.270
I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:18.360
<i>Pilot Daisuke Dojima confirmed.</i>

00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:19.480
Daisuke.

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:21.860
I never told you this before,

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:24.700
but the interface on your String Puppet

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:27.580
was modeled after my sister.

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:32.460
My parents
and my sister died protecting me.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:34.540
After that,

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:38.920
I didn't know anymore whom I was
protecting or whom I was fighting.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:41.380
I simply obeyed orders from AHRV.

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:43.800
But I'm different now.

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:47.100
The people of Shibuya must live,
especially you guys.

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:48.600
That's what I want.

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:50.010
Milo.

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:51.770
And if...

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:56.310
If the word "destiny"
is causing you so much trouble,

00:12:57.190 --> 00:13:00.730
would it better if I don't tell you
anything about that?

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.450
No. Tell me that.

00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:07.990
<i>Ever since then, that word</i>

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:11.490
<i>has supported me.</i>

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:13.660
All right.

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:15.460
I swear that I'll tell you

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:18.080
that it is your destiny
to protect everyone.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:22.380
I swear that I'll never forget it.

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:25.470
<i>And</i>

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:27.930
<i>I'll make it a reality.</i>

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.650
All right, everyone.

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:42.480
It's hunting time!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:48.200
SHIBUYA STATION

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:55.790
<i>I will pass through the zone soon.</i>

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:06.800
They're here, Lu!

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:08.220
Scum!

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:18.350
<i>Everyone, you must survive this battle.</i>

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:21.560
<i>I know that you will find a way.</i>

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.150
You're amazing, Lu!

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:27.400
Scumbags!

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:31.490
Daisuke!

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:37.290
I'll show you that I can protect everyone!

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.210
Hurry up!

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:45.840
Everyone, stay calm.

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:49.470
It's all right.

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:52.470
The SDS will protect us all.

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:55.930
Yes. The Revisions haven't come here.

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:59.600
Like you predicted,
they're not coming after their ancestors.

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:00.650
Excuse me.

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.860
Give this message
to Marimari and the others.

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:05.690
<i>Tell them that we're fine
and that we're doing our best.</i>

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:08.190
Lu! There's one on the base!

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:10.200
What? You must be kidding!

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.870
<i>A lot is coming from Dogenzaka!</i>

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:18.960
There are so many of them.
This is way more than we expected.

00:15:29.050 --> 00:15:31.340
<i>Please do your best.</i>

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:38.020
I didn't realize
that there were still many of them.

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:39.640
<i>Daisuke, let me relieve you.</i>

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:42.270
So, this is a competition to see
who kills the most, huh?

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:44.940
<i>You got it. What will we bet?</i>

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:46.400
Lunch A in the cafeteria.

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:49.610
<i>Right. With a drink!</i>

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:52.280
<i>Language data received
from unknown source.</i>

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:53.530
<i>Playing.</i>

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:55.950
<i>"I will never forgive you,</i>

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:57.370
<i>Daisuke Dojima."</i>

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.120
It's that guy!

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.500
Gai! It's the dark one!

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:03.580
<i>What?</i>

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:08.920
Are you playing around, Mukyu?

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:09.960
<i>Buzz off!</i>

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:13.680
<i>It's important
to make the ancient people feel despair.</i>

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:15.180
<i>Shut up and watch.</i>

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:19.100
<i>What? Who's that?</i>

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:21.100
<i>Gespenst.</i>

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:26.610
Mukyu,

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:30.230
do you know
why we have to change the past?

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:31.900
<i>What?</i>

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:33.400
It's time!

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:36.620
<i>What are you talking about
at a time like this?</i>

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:42.160
A single life can only exist
during a single flow of time.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:45.670
Therefore, for those of us
born after the pandemic,

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:48.710
our only fate is to suffer
with this disease.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:51.630
We never had a choice.

00:16:57.350 --> 00:17:00.560
Disparity and extinction.
Despair and hope.

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:02.810
Fate and destiny.

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:04.190
All these things

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:07.230
are brought about
only because the thing we call time

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:08.520
flows in one direction.

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:10.270
<i>Are you trying to act like a philosopher?</i>

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:12.780
<i>When you speak
beyond your status and ability...</i>

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.740
This is something

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:18.160
that appeared in place of the boy who
has disappeared into a gap in time-space.

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:23.000
Therefore, it must be something
that signifies time.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:24.500
Yes!

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:28.920
I understand it now that I'm connected
to the artificial quantum brain.

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:32.130
<i>Hey. What are you doing, Nicholas?</i>

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:35.380
I will merge with the Crystal of the Void

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:38.890
and escape the shackles of time!

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:45.940
I'll use normal
and burst rounds simultaneously

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:47.730
to gain an advantage!

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:00.280
What should I do?

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:02.240
I can't defeat this one.

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:13.840
What's that?

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:15.010
It's right above us!

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:17.930
Crap! It has discovered
the people underground!

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:20.180
Lu!

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:23.600
Sorry, I can't respond right now!
Enemies are coming from every side!

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:26.230
What the heck are you doing, Daisuke?

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:33.270
I'm the one you need to fight!

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:34.780
Die!

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:43.530
Ms. Yumiko.

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:45.490
Are you okay, Temari?

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.210
COPYING MULTIPLE FILES

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:55.210
Yes!

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:57.420
As long as this is safe...

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:03.760
<i>"Everyone hates you.</i>

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:06.560
<i>-I'm sure you're aware of it.</i>
-Goddammit.

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:09.440
<i>-But by acting like you don't know,</i>
-How dare you say all that crap?

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:11.440
<i>you've just been protecting yourself..."</i>

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:14.730
Wait!

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:25.490
-What?
<i>-"Run away, Marimari."</i>

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:32.080
Could that be...

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:34.750
Keisaku?

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:46.600
Daisuke!

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:48.600
Keisaku? Is that you, Keisaku?

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:52.270
Get back, Daisuke!

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:53.980
<i>Gai, don't shoot!</i>

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:56.820
This might be Keisaku!

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:58.480
Keisaku?

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:00.490
Daisuke, behind you!

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:07.740
<i>"Accept that everything</i>

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:09.910
<i>-is impossible."</i>
-Keisaku...

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:19.340
Daisuke! Are you all right?

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:22.130
Yes. I'm fine.

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:41.740
We won.

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:25.880
SEVERAL HOURS EARLIER

00:22:26.010 --> 00:22:27.840
I'm going to time-leap to 2010 now.

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:31.050
I want to make a final confirmation
of the mission details.

00:22:31.640 --> 00:22:32.890
<i>Understood.</i>

00:22:33.350 --> 00:22:36.850
<i>Balancer Milo, your mission
to accomplish in 2010</i>

00:22:36.930 --> 00:22:39.310
<i>is to eliminate Keisaku Asano.</i>

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:41.150
<i>Feign a kidnapping</i>

00:22:41.360 --> 00:22:43.770
<i>and eliminate the Puppet Master,
Keisaku Asano.</i>

00:22:44.480 --> 00:22:47.490
<i>I repeat. You must eliminate</i>

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:48.610
<i>Keisaku Asano.</i>

00:22:50.070 --> 00:22:52.070
Subtitle translation by Brian Athey
